{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51067","headline":" · 崔致远","name":"","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（案《全唐诗》无崔致远诗。\n日本河世宁《全唐诗逸》卷中收致远诗一首又句七联。\n此六十首诗载致远所着《桂苑笔耕集》〖有《四部丛刊》本〗。\n今即自《丛刊》本录出，而以南京图书馆所藏高丽聚珍活字本校之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51067.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51067","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}